  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Aktiviteten saknar beskrivning. Kontakta Sida f&#xf6;r mer information. Ring +46 8 698 50 00 eller skicka e-post till sida@sida.se.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Three-year project of continued support to forestry education for the Armenien forestry sector.The overall objective is to develop an institutionalised forestry department within the Armenian Academy of Agriculture, support the forestry sector ie sustainable development of forest and forestry to meet national needs in the social, environmental and economic aspects. Partners are AAA and SLU.</narrative>
